//- #4223: "Bigboard" board view - Kanboard's BigBoard plugin equivalent.
//- Stacks EVERY board the current user is a member of on one scrollable
//- page, each as its own compact kanban section (title + its own lists/
//- cards), reusing the same swimlanes/listsGroup + list/card templates the
//- normal single-board views already use so drag-and-drop, card popups and
//- list editing work exactly as on a regular board page.
template(name="bigboardView")
  .bigboard-view
    if isLoading
      p.quiet {{_ 'loading'}}
    else if hasBoards
      each bigboardBoards
        .bigboard-board(data-board-id="{{_id}}")
          h2.bigboard-board-title
            a.bigboard-board-link(href="{{pathFor 'board' id=_id slug=slug}}") {{title}}
          .bigboard-board-lists
            +listsGroup(this)
    else
      p.quiet {{_ 'no-boards-selected'}}
